          "concept": "Colonial Plantation Monoculture",
          "explanation": "Colonial forestry replaced diverse natural mixed forests with single commercial species (e.g., teak, pine), causing long-term ecological degradation.",
          "source_context": "NCERT Class 10 Geography Chapter 2"
        },
        {
          "concept": "Traditional Rainwater Harvesting Traditions",
          "explanation": "Century-old indigenous hydrological engineering such as Guls/Kuls in Himalayas, Khadins in Jaisalmer, and Johads in Alwar.",
          "source_context": "NCERT Class 10 Geography Chapter 3"
        }
      ],
